### AccountOS API Test Endpoints
### Development: http://localhost:5043 veya https://localhost:7043

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7043/api/v1

### ===============================
### AUTHENTICATION
### ===============================

### 1. Register (Kayıt ol)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "test123",
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "User",
  "phone": "+90 555 123 4567"
}

### 2. Login (Giriş yap)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "test123"
}

### 3. Extract Access Token
@accessToken = {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### ===============================
### SAMPLE ENDPOINTS (Protected)
### ===============================

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/sample/health

### Create Sample (Validation Error - name boş)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sample
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "description": "test"
}

### Create Sample (Success)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sample
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Product",
  "description": "Test Description"
}

### Get Sample (test için bir guid koy)
@sampleId = 3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
GET {{baseUrl}}/sample/{{sampleId}}

### ===============================
### COMPANIES (JWT REQUIRED)
### ===============================

### 1. Create Company
# @name createCompany
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Yeni Şirket A.Ş.",
  "taxNumber": "1234567890",
  "taxOffice": "Ankara Vergi Dairesi",
  "phone": "+90 312 555 1234",
  "email": "info@yenisirket.com",
  "address": "Ankara Caddesi No:123",
  "city": "Ankara",
  "country": "TR",
  "baseCurrency": "TRY",
  "defaultLanguage": "TR",
  "timeZone": "Europe/Istanbul"
}

### 2. Get My Companies
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 3. Extract Company ID from Create Response
@companyId = {{createCompany.response.body.data.id}}

### 4. Get Company By ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 5. Update Company (Owner/Admin only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{companyId}}",
  "name": "Güncellenmiş Şirket A.Ş.",
  "taxNumber": "9876543210",
  "taxOffice": "İstanbul Vergi Dairesi",
  "phone": "+90 212 555 9999",
  "email": "info@updated-company.com",
  "address": "Yeni Adres No:456",
  "city": "İstanbul",
  "country": "TR",
  "baseCurrency": "USD",
  "defaultLanguage": "EN",
  "timeZone": "Europe/Istanbul",
  "primaryColor": "#FF5733"
}

### 6. Set Default Company
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/set-default
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7. Invite User to Company (Owner/Admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}/invite
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companyId": "{{companyId}}",
  "email": "newuser@example.com",
  "role": "Manager"
}

### 8. Delete Company (Soft Delete - Owner only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/companies/{{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ===============================
### CURRENCIES & FX RATES
### ===============================

### 1. Get All Currencies
GET {{baseUrl}}/currencies
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2. Get All Currencies (Including Inactive)
GET {{baseUrl}}/currencies?activeOnly=false
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 3. Create Currency
POST {{baseUrl}}/currencies
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "CHF",
  "name": "Swiss Franc",
  "symbol": "Fr",
  "decimalPlaces": 2,
  "displayOrder": 9
}

### 4. Create FX Rate (USD to TRY)
POST {{baseUrl}}/currencies/fx-rates
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "baseCurrencyCode": "USD",
  "quoteCurrencyCode": "TRY",
  "rate": 32.50,
  "effectiveDate": "2025-10-18",
  "source": "Manual"
}

### 5. Create FX Rate (EUR to TRY)
POST {{baseUrl}}/currencies/fx-rates
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "baseCurrencyCode": "EUR",
  "quoteCurrencyCode": "TRY",
  "rate": 35.20,
  "effectiveDate": "2025-10-18",
  "source": "Manual"
}

### 6. Get Current FX Rate (USD/TRY)
GET {{baseUrl}}/currencies/fx-rates/USD/TRY
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7. Get Current FX Rate (EUR/TRY)
GET {{baseUrl}}/currencies/fx-rates/EUR/TRY
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 8. Get Historical FX Rate (USD/TRY for specific date)
GET {{baseUrl}}/currencies/fx-rates/USD/TRY?asOfDate=2025-10-18
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 9. Get FX Rate for Same Currency (Should return 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/currencies/fx-rates/USD/USD
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ===============================
### CUSTOMERS (CARI HESAP)
### ===============================

### 1. Get All Customers
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2. Search Customers
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers?searchTerm=test&activeOnly=true
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 3. Create Individual Customer (Bireysel)
# @name createIndividualCustomer
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ahmet Yılmaz",
  "type": 0,
  "email": "ahmet@example.com",
  "phone": "+90 532 123 4567",
  "mobilePhone": "+90 532 123 4567",
  "identityNumber": "12345678901",
  "billingAddress": "İstanbul Caddesi No:123",
  "city": "İstanbul",
  "country": "Türkiye",
  "postalCode": "34000",
  "currency": "TRY",
  "creditLimit": 50000,
  "paymentTermDays": 30,
  "notes": "VIP müşteri"
}

### 4. Create Corporate Customer (Kurumsal)
# @name createCorporateCustomer
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ABC Ticaret A.Ş.",
  "type": 1,
  "email": "info@abc.com",
  "phone": "+90 212 555 1234",
  "website": "www.abc.com",
  "taxNumber": "1234567890",
  "taxOffice": "Kadıköy Vergi Dairesi",
  "billingAddress": "Atatürk Bulvarı No:456",
  "shippingAddress": "Fabrika Caddesi No:789",
  "city": "İstanbul",
  "country": "Türkiye",
  "postalCode": "34100",
  "currency": "USD",
  "creditLimit": 100000,
  "paymentTermDays": 60,
  "notes": "Kurumsal müşteri"
}

### 5. Extract Customer ID from Create Response
@customerId = {{createCorporateCustomer.response.body.data.id}}

### 6. Get Customer By ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/customers/{{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7. Update Customer
PUT {{baseUrl}}/customers/{{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{customerId}}",
  "name": "ABC Ticaret A.Ş. - Güncellendi",
  "type": 1,
  "email": "info.updated@abc.com",
  "phone": "+90 212 555 9999",
  "website": "www.abc-updated.com",
  "taxNumber": "1234567890",
  "taxOffice": "Kadıköy Vergi Dairesi",
  "billingAddress": "Yeni Adres No:999",
  "shippingAddress": "Yeni Fabrika Adresi",
  "city": "Ankara",
  "country": "Türkiye",
  "postalCode": "06000",
  "currency": "EUR",
  "creditLimit": 150000,
  "paymentTermDays": 90,
  "notes": "Güncellendi - EUR'ya geçti"
}

### 8. Delete Customer (Soft Delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/customers/{{customerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ===============================
### PRODUCTS (ÜRÜNLER)
### ===============================

### 1. Get All Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2. Search Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?searchTerm=laptop&activeOnly=true
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 3. Get Only Stock Tracked Products
GET {{baseUrl}}/products?trackStockOnly=true
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4. Create Product (Goods - Mal) with Translations
# @name createProduct
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Laptop Dell XPS 15",
  "description": "15 inch, Intel i7, 16GB RAM",
  "type": 0,
  "barcode": "1234567890123",
  "purchasePrice": 15000,
  "salePrice": 22000,
  "currency": "TRY",
  "vatRate": 20,
  "unit": "Adet",
  "trackStock": true,
  "minStockLevel": 5,
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/laptop.jpg",
  "translations": [
    {
      "languageCode": "EN",
      "name": "Dell XPS 15 Laptop",
      "description": "15 inch, Intel i7, 16GB RAM"
    },
    {
      "languageCode": "RU",
      "name": "Ноутбук Dell XPS 15",
      "description": "15 дюймов, Intel i7, 16 ГБ ОЗУ"
    }
  ]
}

### 5. Create Product (Service - Hizmet)
POST {{baseUrl}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Web Tasarım Hizmeti",
  "description": "Kurumsal web sitesi tasarımı",
  "type": 1,
  "purchasePrice": 0,
  "salePrice": 5000,
  "currency": "TRY",
  "vatRate": 20,
  "unit": "Saat",
  "trackStock": false,
  "minStockLevel": 0,
  "translations": [
    {
      "languageCode": "EN",
      "name": "Web Design Service",
      "description": "Corporate website design"
    }
  ]
}

### 6. Extract Product ID from Create Response
@productId = {{createProduct.response.body.data.id}}

### 7. Get Product By ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 8. Update Product
PUT {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{productId}}",
  "name": "Laptop Dell XPS 15 - Güncellendi",
  "description": "15 inch, Intel i9, 32GB RAM",
  "type": 0,
  "barcode": "1234567890123",
  "purchasePrice": 18000,
  "salePrice": 25000,
  "currency": "TRY",
  "vatRate": 20,
  "unit": "Adet",
  "trackStock": true,
  "minStockLevel": 10,
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/laptop-new.jpg"
}

### 9. Delete Product (Soft Delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ===============================
### PROTECTED ENDPOINTS (JWT Required)
### ===============================

### Test Protected Endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/sample/health
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

